  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CDC Cooperative Agreements to Improve the Health Status of Minority Populations: Evidence and Innovations for Public Health Actions in Guatemala and Central America</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide support for activities which have the potential to improve the health status and/or quality of life of racial/ethnic minorities, with the objective of reducing the excessive burden and death borne by minority and disadvantaged populations.</narrative>
